bling  commission told sky news since jack's  death in 2017 we have accelerated our  drive to make gambling safer this has  included increased enforcement and  compliance activity clamp down on online  slots products increased online age and  id verification and brought in new rules  to stamp out irresponsible vip customer  practices  isn't charles ritchie say much more as  needed the coroner agrees and has sent a  report to the government setting out how  to prevent deaths like jax which will  inform a review into gambling laws  expected to come out this spring jason  farrell sky news
 

